answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/choices "42f87aa9-879c-59c1-852b-15543ef4ee46"] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/choices "877fa2e8-f5bb-5037-b231-65d49ffccb4a"] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/choices "080c4046-bab0-52f9-916f-bcdf42770e3b"] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/choices "adfad09e-4bd7-5824-b68d-57355af06e5b"] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/choices "605c88d0-f1ca-5fea-979e-2d6f57d2a2cf"] [:db/add "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/correct "877fa2e8-f5bb-5037-b231-65d49ffccb4a"] [:db/ensure "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/id #uuid "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749"] [:db/add "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sec{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/answer-fields "43b4217c-426e-5ba3-b654-1f527b2dd01e"] [:db/ensure "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "9c7d00a7-9e77-5fba-9fff-3a5de26e8749"] [:db/add "19dc5c65-0a09-59ef-9ce9-5b5d649ebf96" :answer/id #uuid "19dc5c65-0a09-59ef-9ce9-5b5d649ebf96"] [:db/add "19dc5c65-0a09-59ef-9ce9-5b5d649ebf96" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "19dc5c65-0a09-59ef-9ce9-5b5d649ebf96" :answer/value "- 2 \\csc{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "19dc5c65-0a09-59ef-9ce9-5b5d649ebf96" :answer/validate] [:db/add "114c2ffe-bf8e-5e91-9d8b-604a58284576" :answer/id #uuid "114c2ffe-bf8e-5e91-9d8b-604a58284576"] [:db/add "114c2ffe-bf8e-5e91-9d8b-604a58284576" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "114c2ffe-bf8e-5e91-9d8b-604a58284576" :answer/value "- \\frac{2 \\csc{\\left(6 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "114c2ffe-bf8e-5e91-9d8b-604a58284576" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2c072524-94fe-5ad4-81f1-8a046b1a0273" :answer/id #uuid "2c072524-94fe-5ad4-81f1-8a046b1a0273"] [:db/add "2c072524-94fe-5ad4-81f1-8a046b1a0273" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2c072524-94fe-5ad4-81f1-8a046b1a0273" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "2c072524-94fe-5ad4-81f1-8a046b1a0273" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34c0f425-45c1-5934-81bf-672c640c7781" :answer/id #uuid "34c0f425-45c1-5934-81bf-672c640c7781"] [:db/add "34c0f425-45c1-5934-81bf-672c640c7781" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34c0f425-45c1-5934-81bf-672c640c7781" :answer/value "- \\frac{2 \\csc{\\left(x \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "34c0f425-45c1-5934-81bf-672c640c7781" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ef3e8960-8194-5bc9-9b2d-1dfa080951cc" :answer/id #uuid "ef3e8960-8194-5bc9-9b2d-1dfa080951cc"] [:db/add "ef3e8960-8194-5bc9-9b2d-1dfa080951cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ef3e8960-8194-5bc9-9b2d-1dfa080951cc" :answer/value "- \