m{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{2 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2 \\csc{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7aeb4901-b34d-5d81-a7cc-78f1b155f72f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "7aeb4901-b34d-5d81-a7cc-78f1b155f72f" :question/answer-fields "77848623-3004-5bf6-afa8-5147b7ef7ca2"] [:db/ensure "7aeb4901-b34d-5d81-a7cc-78f1b155f72f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "7aeb4901-b34d-5d81-a7cc-78f1b155f72f"] [:db/add "ef04fdff-712d-5652-852f-7fdd57e7a177" :answer/id #uuid "ef04fdff-712d-5652-852f-7fdd57e7a177"] [:db/add "ef04fdff-712d-5652-852f-7fdd57e7a177" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ef04fdff-712d-5652-852f-7fdd57e7a177" :answer/value "- 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "ef04fdff-712d-5652-852f-7fdd57e7a177" :answer/validate] [:db/add "518e3c70-be9c-557c-8df7-911a99c194f6" :answer/id #uuid "518e3c70-be9c-557c-8df7-911a99c194f6"] [:db/add "518e3c70-be9c-557c-8df7-911a99c194f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "518e3c70-be9c-557c-8df7-911a99c194f6" :answer/value "- \\cot{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "518e3c70-be9c-557c-8df7-911a99c194f6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6f146670-785e-59b9-a3e5-58c324991e21" :answer/id #uuid "6f146670-785e-59b9-a3e5-58c324991e21"] [:db/add "6f146670-785e-59b9-a3e5-58c324991e21" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6f146670-785e-59b9-a3e5-58c324991e21" :answer/value "- \\cot{\\left(2 x + 1 \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "6f146670-785e-59b9-a3e5-58c324991e21" :answer/validate] [:db/add "692b14c2-f090-56e7-8f94-fb854d63773a" :answer/id #uuid "692b14c2-f090-56e7-8f94-fb854d63773a"] [:db/add "692b14c2-f090-56e7-8f94-fb854d63773a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "692b14c2-f090-56e7-8f94-fb854d63773a" :answer/value "- 3 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\r