 2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "22be6cf5-7a6e-540f-98f4-cbe304eff18a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "22be6cf5-7a6e-540f-98f4-cbe304eff18a" :question/answer-fields "4c5835df-3720-587c-9d8a-5bc25dc4c440"] [:db/ensure "22be6cf5-7a6e-540f-98f4-cbe304eff18a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "22be6cf5-7a6e-540f-98f4-cbe304eff18a"] [:db/add "4745210f-56ee-51f9-ab10-ad6f932f9f9d" :answer/id #uuid "4745210f-56ee-51f9-ab10-ad6f932f9f9d"] [:db/add "4745210f-56ee-51f9-ab10-ad6f932f9f9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4745210f-56ee-51f9-ab10-ad6f932f9f9d" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "4745210f-56ee-51f9-ab10-ad6f932f9f9d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3f598cdf-e0e7-5c53-9534-389b7b3461d4" :answer/id #uuid "3f598cdf-e0e7-5c53-9534-389b7b3461d4"] [:db/add "3f598cdf-e0e7-5c53-9534-389b7b3461d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3f598cdf-e0e7-5c53-9534-389b7b3461d4" :answer/value "\\frac{\\tan{\\left(8 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "3f598cdf-e0e7-5c53-9534-389b7b3461d4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ab98c97-2995-5686-80fd-59c000a0680c" :answer/id #uuid "0ab98c97-2995-5686-80fd-59c000a0680c"] [:db/add "0ab98c97-2995-5686-80fd-59c000a0680c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ab98c97-2995-5686-80fd-59c000a0680c" :answer/value "\\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [:db/ensure "0ab98c97-2995-5686-80fd-59c000a0680c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "71a1d802-4345-5e2e-81e3-bf4ccc709849" :answer/id #uuid "71a1d802-4345-5e2e-81e3-bf4ccc709849"] [:db/add "71a1d