:question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\tan{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5d23c6ec-b347-5bbf-9f87-ded6cedba21a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5d23c6ec-b347-5bbf-9f87-ded6cedba21a" :question/answer-fields "b35a0e29-fab2-5b38-8e99-179e66dfb031"] [:db/ensure "5d23c6ec-b347-5bbf-9f87-ded6cedba21a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "5d23c6ec-b347-5bbf-9f87-ded6cedba21a"] [:db/add "ca9768fe-d693-5de5-8076-cdd1801fe56b" :answer/id #uuid "ca9768fe-d693-5de5-8076-cdd1801fe56b"] [:db/add "ca9768fe-d693-5de5-8076-cdd1801fe56b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ca9768fe-d693-5de5-8076-cdd1801fe56b" :answer/value "\\sec{\\left(3 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "ca9768fe-d693-5de5-8076-cdd1801fe56b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a7f75e26-758a-5317-af28-87b501fa1ac6" :answer/id #uuid "a7f75e26-758a-5317-af28-87b501fa1ac6"] [:db/add "a7f75e26-758a-5317-af28-87b501fa1ac6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a7f75e26-758a-5317-af28-87b501fa1ac6" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "a7f75e26-758a-5317-af28-87b501fa1ac6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ef384e44-ab6a-5a24-bf83-5440b4909f93" :answer/id #uuid "ef384e44-ab6a-5a24-bf83-5440b4909f93"] [:db/add "ef384e44-ab6a-5a24-bf83-5440b4909f93" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ef384e44-ab6a-5a24-bf83-5440b4909f93" :answer/valu