" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(3 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "689a1f26-472d-5dda-ace6-adc6532b3278" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\tan{\\left(3 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sec{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "689a1f26-472d-5dda-ace6-adc6532b3278" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "689a1f26-472d-5dda-ace6-adc6532b3278" :question/answer-fields "df3ec475-4c83-5f86-ac74-f177281e03f3"] [:db/ensure "689a1f26-472d-5dda-ace6-adc6532b3278" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "689a1f26-472d-5dda-ace6-adc6532b3278"] [:db/add "85356bf6-114d-54eb-9da9-71771253d50b" :answer/id #uuid "85356bf6-114d-54eb-9da9-71771253d50b"] [:db/add "85356bf6-114d-54eb-9da9-71771253d50b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "85356bf6-114d-54eb-9da9-71771253d50b" :answer/value "4 x+C"] [:db/ensure "85356bf6-114d-54eb-9da9-71771253d50b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8d42fa6b-f889-5c19-8ab1-605eb3a8ea92" :answer/id #uuid "8d42fa6b-f889-5c19-8ab1-605eb3a8ea92"] [:db/add "8d42fa6b-f889-5c19-8ab1-605eb3a8ea92" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8d42fa6b-f889-5c19-8ab1-605eb3a8ea92" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\csc{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{4}+C"] [